                                            *                  is waken up by an external stimulus other than ACTIVIF.      D:\PICs\ControlBoard\system\usb\usbdrv\usbdrv.c
                                            *                  Please read the note below to understand the limitations.    D:\PICs\ControlBoard\system\usb\usbdrv\usbdrv.c
