                                            * Note:            The modifiable section in this routine should be changed     D:\PICs\ControlBoard\system\usb\usbdrv\usbdrv.c
                                            *                  to meet the application needs. Current implementation        D:\PICs\ControlBoard\system\usb\usbdrv\usbdrv.c
                                            *                  temporary blocks other functions from executing for a        D:\PICs\ControlBoard\system\usb\usbdrv\usbdrv.c
                                            *                  period of 1-13 ms depending on the core frequency.           D:\PICs\ControlBoard\system\usb\usbdrv\usbdrv.c
                                            *                                                                               D:\PICs\ControlBoard\system\usb\usbdrv\usbdrv.c
                                            *                  According to USB 2.0 specification section 7.1.7.7,          D:\PICs\ControlBoard\system\usb\usbdrv\usbdrv.c
