                                            *                  frequencies.                                                 D:\PICs\ControlBoard\system\usb\usbdrv\usbdrv.c
                                            *                  That value selected is 1800. See table below:                D:\PICs\ControlBoard\system\usb\usbdrv\usbdrv.c
