                                            *                                                                               D:\PICs\ControlBoard\system\usb\usbdrv\usbdrv.c
                                            * PreCondition:    A STALL packet is sent to the host by the SIE.               D:\PICs\ControlBoard\system\usb\usbdrv\usbdrv.c
                                            *                                                                               D:\PICs\ControlBoard\system\usb\usbdrv\usbdrv.c
                                            * Input:           None                                                         D:\PICs\ControlBoard\system\usb\usbdrv\usbdrv.c
